      <p style="margin:0 0 10px"><b style="color:#3db8ff;font-size:15px">Own Club — Share Market</b></p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 12px">Own Club — Share Market is a forward-thinking financial and investment platform operated under <b>KMK Holding Co.</b>, established in <b>2018</b> and based in <b>Antalya, Turkey</b>.</p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 12px">Our vision is built around creating opportunities, encouraging responsible participation in financial markets, and bringing together modern business thinking, financial knowledge, and strategic leadership.</p>
