        <p style="margin:0 0 8px">Muhammad Ali serves as the Chairman of Own Club — Share Market and provides strategic direction and leadership at the highest level.</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 8px">He holds a Bachelor’s Degree in Business Administration, giving him a strong academic foundation in management, organizational strategy, business operations, and corporate decision-making.</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 8px">As Chairman, Muhammad Ali focuses on long-term vision, corporate development, strategic partnerships, and ensuring that the company continues to operate with a clear and structured business philosophy.</p>
        <p style="margin:0">His approach combines business knowledge with strategic leadership, helping guide Own Club toward sustainable growth and expansion.</p>
