        <div style="font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-bottom:6px">Ahmed Abo Jassim — Chief Executive Officer</div>
        <p style="margin:0 0 8px">Ahmed Abo Jassim serves as the Chief Executive Officer of Own Club — Share Market.</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 8px">He holds a Bachelor’s Degree in Business Administration as well as a Diploma in Finance, giving him a combination of business management and financial knowledge.</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 8px">As CEO, Ahmed Abo Jassim is responsible for translating the company’s vision into day-to-day strategy and operations. His background allows him to approach business decisions from both a management and financial perspective.</p>
        <p style="margin:0">He plays a key role in business development, operational leadership, strategic planning, and the continued growth of Own Club.</p>
