      <div class="notice" style="margin-bottom:12px">
        <div style="font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-bottom:6px">James Katson — Chief Operating Officer</div>
        <p style="margin:0 0 8px">James Katson serves as the Chief Operating Officer of Own Club — Share Market.</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 8px">His academic background combines Marketing and International Relations, complemented by a Diploma in Finance.</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 8px">This combination gives him a broad understanding of market positioning, communication, international business environments, financial principles, and organizational operations.</p>
        <p style="margin:0">As COO, James Katson focuses on operational efficiency, business processes, market development, and ensuring that the company’s strategic objectives are effectively implemented across its operations.</p>
